   "widgets_values": [
    "## upscale.json\n\nx4 upscale (GAN)\n\n**Does:** one x4 GAN pass - **faithful**, it invents nothing, so it cannot drift away from the source. That is the opposite trade from `upscale-seedvr2.json`, which reconstructs more detail (grad-var 137 vs 98) but moves further from the original (drift 2.70 vs 1.29) and takes ~6x as long.\n**Which to use:** shippable output -> `upscale-seedvr2.json` (Apache-2.0). This flow -> when you want the source respected, and you accept the licence below.\n**Trap:** `4x-UltraSharp` is **non-commercial** - do not ship its output. The loader's model dropdown can be switched to `RealESRGAN_x4plus` (permissive; over-smooths concept art a little) if you need a clean licence without changing flow.\n**Note:** the model multiplies by 4, so a 1024 px input becomes 4096 px. There is no crop here any more - E4 cropped to 512 only so three methods could be compared quickly on the same tile.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S9** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E4b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
